# CQ 4：未來 7 天內到期的事件有哪些？（含今天當下起算 7 天；CQ 原文未限定未結案）
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX tf:   <https://anniechiang-data.framer.website/ontology/talentflow#>
PREFIX xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

SELECT ?event ?label ?deadline WHERE {
  ?event a tf:ComplianceEvent ;
         rdfs:label ?label ;
         tf:hasDeadline ?deadline .
  FILTER(?deadline >= NOW() && ?deadline < NOW() + "P7D"^^xsd:dayTimeDuration)
  FILTER(LANGMATCHES(LANG(?label), "en"))
} ORDER BY ?deadline
